## PHẦN 6: CẤU HÌNH MẪU `rclone.conf`

Sau khi setup, file `rclone.conf` (ở `%APPDATA%\rclone\rclone.conf` trên Windows) sẽ có dạng:

```ini
[mega]
type = mega
user = your-email@gmail.com
pass = xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

[gdrive]
type = drive
scope = drive
token = {"access_token":"...","refresh_token":"...","expiry":"..."}
team_drive =

[megacrypt]
type = crypt
remote = mega:/backup/encrypted
filename_encryption = standard
directory_name_encryption = true
password = xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
password2 = yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy
```

**Xem config:**
```powershell
.\rclone.exe config show mega
.\rclone.exe config file
```

